  "_help_1": "Gate G3 parser correctness audit set (plan 13.4). At least 25 scripted queries covering every listed category; target >= 80% fully correct parses with every failure visible and survivable.",
  "_help_2": "Expectations are declarative ASSERTIONS on the resulting QueryPlan, not a full expected plan. A query counts as fully_correct only if EVERY assertion holds. This keeps the audit robust to incidental atom ordering while still pinning the semantics that matter.",
