  "_help_5": "failure_severity classifies the CONSEQUENCE of a wrong parse. 'unsafe' means the system could confidently answer a different question than the one asked, or invert a truth claim, with no clarification. 'safe_abstain' means it may under-extract or over-ask but never asserts something false. Plan 13.4 requires failures be visible AND survivable, so the gate does not pass while any unsafe failure stands, whatever the score."
